---
description: This project's instructions from instruction.md, kept current in .instruction/current.md
alwaysApply: true
---
If this project has `.instruction/current.md`, it holds the instructions this project follows from instruction.md (the
version `.instruction/follow.json` names, kept current by the plugin's hooks). Read it before you start a task, and
follow it. When a hook adds a newer version of it to the conversation, that version replaces the earlier one in full.
Never edit `.instruction/current.md`: it is replaced at each version. To change the instruction, propose a change on
instruction.md.
